  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-17T18:08:46.026Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Following works without issue,\n\n```\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/F3Pbt9DagAEsR94?format=jpg&name=large\n\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Logo-Test.png?20171228163613\n\nhttps://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Logo-Test.png\n\nhttps://w7.pngwing.com/pngs/550/671/png-transparent-computer-icons-test-event-miscellaneous-text-logo.png\n\n```\n\nWhile this format will crash VRChat.\n\n```\n\nhttps://twitter.com/EngineerNeet/status/1689935977295622144/photo/1\n\n```\n\nImage taken while crash as no logs output.",
